# Footage is 45 GB and never tracked. Directories are re-admitted so git can
# descend into them, and hand-corrected ground truth IS tracked: it is the most
# expensive artifact in the project -- hours of the user's time, unreproducible
# by any amount of compute, and it was silently untracked until now.
assets/**
!assets/**/
!assets/**/*__labels_corrected.csv

# Generated per-game artifacts (caches, plots, thumbnails, cut plays) and the
# repo-root figures are all reproducible from the footage plus the labels.
/analysis/
/plays/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.npy

# models/ is deliberately NOT ignored: the YOLO weights are vendored so that
# Ultralytics never tries to auto-download them at a venue with no internet.
